### Get properties default
GET https://localhost:5001/api/properties
Accept: application/json

### Get properties page 1 sized 6
GET https://localhost:5001/api/properties?page=1&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Get properties page 2 sized 6
GET https://localhost:5001/api/properties?page=2&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Get properties invalid page size
GET https://localhost:5001/api/properties?page=1&pageSize=101
Accept: application/json
